# I0: parameters that exist only on the IMA-ADPCM path.  Kept apart from the
# shared model so a tuning run on an MS-only corpus cannot quietly drift them,
# and so the two formats' quantizers can be swept independently.

Prefix I0
Debug 1
Const 1

# The IMA step index, 0..88, as a threshold map: a 1 opens a new context bucket
# at that position, a 0 merges it into the one before.  All-ones is one bucket
# per index value, which is where the IMA tuning settled -- the full 89-value
# index beat 4-wide bucketing there.
Index Ib
 s0: sidx, 1!1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111
